{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>This month is for you the beginning of months.</b> From here onward, the months are yours, to do with them as you will. But in the days of servitude, your days were not yours — they were for the labor of others and their will. Therefore <b>it is the first for you of the months of the year</b>, for in it your chosen existence (הַמְּצִיאוּת הַבְּחִירִית) began."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:08.321394164Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}